WEBVTT

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:01.476
as you can see.

00:05:01.476 --> 00:05:05.436
They face both social and institutional
barriers to full equality,

00:05:05.476 --> 00:05:07.396
not just because they're chicks,

00:05:07.396 --> 00:05:12.396
but because of things such as race,
religion, sexuality or disability.

00:05:13.116 --> 00:05:16.196
They basically have a double whammy.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:20.196
And that concept is referred to
as intersectionality.

00:05:20.876 --> 00:05:26.596
Now, as an Australian woman
who's originally from Afghanistan

00:05:26.636 --> 00:05:28.156
and a Muslim,

00:05:28.156 --> 00:05:29.796
I get the triple whammy.